God, it's about freakin time.
I've been playing off and on for 6 years now, but just started using
spoilers about 4 months ago. and now i'm done for a while haha.
anyways
This was one of the first times that the RNG actually helped me for a
change (my second ascendable character that i've ever had, the first i
accidentally FoD'd myself, dywypi?). Early on, wound up with a +oId,
and hit an altar on dlvl 6, and since i started with a =oSD, a
sacrifest ensued and i wound up with MB, trollbane, dragonbane,
firebrand and a +1 stormy. next level, i found a WoW! ID'd it, it was
0:1, so i wished up some blessed scrolls of charging, wound up with +3
SDSM, Speed Boots, and a HoB. Soko was uneventful, but i got my BoH,
so i was happy. i had also found a cursed ?oGeno, so i reverse geno'd
nurses, blanked some scrolls by the oracle and blessed some geno
scrolls. goodbye h, L and ;.
Wound up with a luckstone from a death drop, then decided to take on
the mines, letting a +4 stormy wipe out anything in my path. killed
everyone (except Izchak and the cross aligned priest) in minetown,
worked my way down to mine's end, and decided against it, since i
found another luckstone on the way.
The quest was very easy, with stormy up to +5 by then, i blew through
it and was making my way to medusa.
wound up getting crowned while making holy water, but i'm ok with
that, FoD is worth the extended prayer timeout (i only prayed one
other time after that; got slimed in soko on my ascent).
On the way, i found ludios, so i wiped out everyone there, and ran
back to minetown to donate. AC: -23, good to go.
Wound up in the titan medusa level, so i lined up and gave him the
finger.
didn't have levitation, so i dug down, wound up on the next level by
the stairs, blindfolded and came back up. hacked medusa to death with
stormy, and was on my way to the castle, where i found a =oLev. i
don't have a problem with playing the passtune; in fact i did it last
time i played, but this time i came in from behind and let stormy do
my work.
Cleared the castle, had 2 WoW, one at 1:0, the other at 0:3.
awesome.
and found a "oLS. Even more awesome.
Dropped in the trap door, and hit the valley of the dead. a minotaur
rushed me, i FoD'd him, and lured wraiths upstairs. no luck on
corpses. i sat on the throne and got a geno. goodbye minotaurs.
Juiblex, Yeenoghu and Orcus were all summoned by a balrog. crap. but
at least i didn't have to fight them later.
The dive down to the bottom wasn't bad at all, paid off baalz and
asmodeus, vlad went down without a fight, and i fingered rodney, so he
was no trouble (i waited until i cleared the VS level to kill rodney,
didn't wanna dig with rodney coming in.)
invocation ritual performed, wished for a =oConflict. let the bastards
in the sanctum kill each other, and wished up another magic marker. +6
stormy, +2 magicbane, +4 fireproof speed boots, and my ?oGD for the
planes.
The door to the sanctuary was on the top of the room; i checked the
other 3 sides first unfortunately. Fingered moloch's priest, nabbed
the amulet and made my ascent.
i ran into rodney a few times (3) and got mysterious forced 3 times,
but only one of them threw me back down a level.
the rest of the ascent was pretty uneventful, aside from my =oLev
getting cursed while wearing it, nobody stole the "oY from me. i went
to soko to write up a few more ?oGD, when i realized i was out of
blank scrolls (except one cursed and one blessed), and didn't wanna
waste the time blanking any more, and wound up getting slimed while
reading to refresh spells.
Prayed to save my sliming, munched a C-Ration and continued upwards.
Got to my altar from the sac fest, dropped my 12 +0 daggers i had
quivered because i didn't throw them once the whole game, and tossed
trollbane, werebane and dragonbane into my BoH for points.
Continued up, and Dlvl1, found my former pet kitten. which stormy made
quick work of.
onward to the planes, where i fingered rodney and his clone for the
last time, zapped dig and \oD to get to the portal on the other side
of the level.
plane of air was brutal; i wound up getting engulfed quite a bit, and
had to quaff a few !oEH. Managed to FoD a path to the portal and move
on to fire. I healed up on fire, forgot i had taken my =oLev off to
grab a potion from the floor and *splash* sunk in lava. Threw the
=oLev back on, and had one leg stuck while i let stormy rape a fire
giant, got out of the lava and OH CRAP my ?oGD burned up (i had the
others in my BoH, but only had one left for plane of water at this
point). I pulled the spare out, found the portal and avoided
everything along the way.
Plane of water, not a problem since i geno'd ;, just had water
elementals to deal with (i was greased anyways). had to burn my 2
spare blank scrolls (cursed and blessed) to find the portal.
onward to astral plane.
got my guardian angel, which stormy wound up killing (whoops), and i
plowed my way to the altar on the left, famine was there, so i figured
he'd be the easiest if he popped up again.
Whoops, neutral altar. Wound up killing famine 4 times.
onward to the middle altar, which was my chaotic altar! got killed on
the way up to it; but my "oLS revived me, and i made my way to the
altar. I accidentally hit the priest with stormy, bam, AC: -14, and he
stood on the altar until i killed him.
